# llama-server logs at -lv 5 print the prompts themselves. They are evidence for a
# measurement, never something this repo may carry. The file name is not a guarantee:
# the model-switch runs wrote prompts into switched-*.log, which a server*.log rule
# never saw. So every log here is out, and committing one is an explicit `git add -f`.
dev/results/**/*.log
